    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>QtyGuard &#8211; Minimum Quantity for WooCommerce allows store owners to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Set minimum quantity per product</li>\n<li>Set minimum quantity per product variation</li>\n<li>Configure global minimum quantity</li>\n<li>Validate cart automatically</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If no product or variation minimum is set, global minimum is applied.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to /wp-content/plugins/</li>\n<li>Activate via Plugins menu</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce &gt; Minimum Quantity to configure global settings</li>\n<li>Edit product inventory to set per-product rules</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"does%20this%20support%20variations%3F\">\nDoes this support variations?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes. You can set minimum quantity for each variation individually.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"what%20happens%20if%20both%20global%20and%20product%20minimum%20are%20set%3F\">\nWhat happens if both global and product minimum are set?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Product or variation minimum overrides global minimum.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Slug Change</li>\n<li>Code Improved</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Set minimum purchase quantity per product or variation in WooCommerce. Includes global minimum setting.",
    "description": "<p>QtyGuard &#8211; Minimum Quantity for WooCommerce allows store owners to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Set minimum quantity per product</li>\n<li>Set minimum quantity per product variation</li>\n<li>Configure global minimum quantity</li>\n<li>Validate cart automatically</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If no product or variation minimum is set, global minimum is applied.</p>\n",
